usage: csk upgrade [-h] [--all] [--dry-run] [--verbose] [--fix-gitignore]
                   [--strict-tags] [--audit [{advisory,strict}]]
                   [--build-ssh-identity PATH] [--build-ssh-agent [SOCKET]]
                   [--build-ssh-known-hosts PATH]
                   [target]

Fetch the selected project dependency closure, then install.

positional arguments:
  target                project alias, '.', or project path

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --all                 operate on all registered projects
  --dry-run             plan work without modifying files
  --verbose             print detailed progress
  --fix-gitignore       deprecated; prefer csk init
  --strict-tags         fail if an installed tag moved to another commit
  --audit [{advisory,strict}]
                        run audit gate for this install (default mode:
                        advisory)
  --build-ssh-identity PATH
                        SSH identity for private build repositories; a private
                        key, or the matching public key when combined with
                        --build-ssh-agent (env: CSK_BUILD_SSH_IDENTITY)
  --build-ssh-agent [SOCKET]
                        SSH agent socket for private build repositories; bare
                        flag or 'auto' adopts SSH_AUTH_SOCK (env:
                        CSK_BUILD_SSH_AGENT)
  --build-ssh-known-hosts PATH
                        known_hosts file pinning build repository host keys
                        (default: operator home .ssh/known_hosts; env:
                        CSK_BUILD_SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS)

Files read:
  ~/.cocoaskills/config.json, <project>/Skillfile.json, local skill git repositories.
  Missing repositories declared with `git` may be cloned into skills_root.

Files written:
  <project>/.agents/skills, <project>/.agents/bin, .agents/env.sh, .agents/env.ps1,
  agent adapter directories, ~/.cocoaskills/runtime, ~/.cocoaskills/cache.

Exit codes:
  0 success, 1 one or more projects/skills failed, 2 config error, 3 lock contention.

Examples:
  csk upgrade
  csk upgrade --all
  csk upgrade demo-app-ios
  csk upgrade .
  csk upgrade /path/to/project
  csk upgrade --fix-gitignore
